WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.920 --> 00:00:01.586
&gt;&gt; Mike: SENATOR RICK SCOTT,

00:00:01.587 --> 00:00:03.422
OUR BEST TO YOU IN THE GREAT

00:00:03.423 --> 00:00:06.458
PEOPLE OF FLORIDA &gt;&gt; THANKS.

00:00:06.459 --> 00:00:07.759
&gt;&gt; Mike: BREAKING TONIGHT,

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:08.827
WHAT WAS SUPPOSED TO BE A

00:00:08.828 --> 00:00:10.095
LIBERTY ADVENTURE HAS TURNED

00:00:10.096 --> 00:00:11.930
INTO A DEADLY NIGHTMARE FOR

00:00:11.931 --> 00:00:13.098
PEOPLE ON A CHARTERED DIVING

00:00:13.099 --> 00:00:14.433
BOAT OFF THE COAST OF

00:00:14.434 --> 00:00:14.833
CALIFORNIA.

00:00:14.834 --> 00:00:17.102
AT LEAST FOUR ARE DEAD AND 29

00:00:17.103 --> 00:00:19.704
MORE ARE MISSING AFTER A

00:00:19.705 --> 00:00:22.974
DEVASTATING EARLY MORNING FIRE.

00:00:22.975 --> 00:00:23.809
CORRESPONDENT CHRISTY O'GORMAN'S

00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:24.476
LIVE IN LOS ANGELES TONIGHT.

00:00:24.477 --> 00:00:26.745
GOOD EVENING.

00:00:26.746 --> 00:00:28.180
&gt;&gt; GOOD EVENING, MIKE.

00:00:28.181 --> 00:00:32.350
A FRANTIC SEARCH IS UNDERWAY FOR

00:00:32.351 --> 00:00:33.652
MORE THAN TWO DOZEN PEOPLE AFTER

00:00:33.653 --> 00:00:34.986
THIS DIVING SHIP BURST INTO

00:00:34.987 --> 00:00:35.954
FLAMES EARLY THIS MORNING

00:00:35.955 --> 00:00:37.856
FORCING THE CREWMEMBERS TO JUMP

00:00:37.857 --> 00:00:38.590
OVERBOARD.

00:00:38.591 --> 00:00:39.925
FOUR BODIES HAVE BEEN RECOVERED

00:00:39.926 --> 00:00:40.325
SO FAR.

00:00:40.326 --> 00:00:41.226
THE COAST GUARD SING THEIR

00:00:41.227 --> 00:00:42.194
INJURIES WERE CONSISTENT WITH

00:00:42.195 --> 00:00:42.561
DROWNING.

00:00:42.562 --> 00:00:45.096
TAKE A LISTEN TO THE DISPATCHER

00:00:45.097 --> 00:00:47.332
ON THE CALL WHEN THE DEADLY FIRE

00:00:47.333 --> 00:00:47.766
WAS REPORTED.

00:00:47.767 --> 00:00:49.835
IF YOU CAN'T HEAR HOW THE

00:00:49.836 --> 00:00:50.702
CREWMEMBERS RESPONDED, BUT IT

00:00:50.703 --> 00:00:53.104
SURE GIVES YOU A SENSE OF THE

00:00:53.105 --> 00:00:53.738
SITUATION.

00:00:53.739 --> 00:00:54.506
&gt;&gt; CAN YOU GET BACK ON BOARD AND

00:00:54.507 --> 00:00:57.108
UNLOCK THE BOAT -- UNLOCK THE

00:00:57.109 --> 00:00:59.778
DOORS SO THEY CAN GET OFF?

00:00:59.779 --> 00:01:00.512
YOU DON'T HAVE ANY FIREFIGHTING

00:01:00.513 --> 00:01:01.346
GEAR AT ALL, NO FIRE

00:01:01.347 --> 00:01:04.583
EXTINGUISHERS OR ANYTHING?

00:01:04.584 --> 00:01:05.317
IS THIS THE CAPTAIN?

00:01:05.318 --> 00:01:05.984
WAS THAT ALL THE CREW THAT

00:01:05.985 --> 00:01:07.752
JUMPED OFF?

00:01:07.753 --> 00:01:08.487
THERE'S NO ESCAPE HATCH FOR ANY

00:01:08.488 --> 00:01:13.859
OF THE PEOPLE ON BOARD?

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:14.993
&gt;&gt; COAST GUARD ALL RUSHED TO THE

00:01:14.994 --> 00:01:16.228
SCENE WAS THE CALL CAME IN

00:01:16.229 --> 00:01:17.929
AROUND 3:30 THIS MORNING.

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:20.966
39 PEOPLE WERE ABOARD THE DIVING

00:01:20.967 --> 00:01:21.967
SHIP CONCEPTION INCLUDING FIVE

00:01:21.968 --> 00:01:24.870
CREWMEMBERS WHOM ALL MADE IT OFF

00:01:24.871 --> 00:01:27.072
THE 75-FOOT BOAT NEAR SANTA CRUZ

00:01:27.073 --> 00:01:27.405
ISLAND.

00:01:27.406 --> 00:01:29.140
THE COAST GUARD OFFICER SAYS

00:01:29.141 --> 00:01:30.775
PEOPLE WERE BELOW DECK ASLEEP,

00:01:30.776 --> 00:01:31.443
HOWEVER, THOSE FIVE GROOMERS

00:01:31.444 --> 00:01:32.777
WERE AWAKE AND ABOVE DECK AND

00:01:32.778 --> 00:01:34.880
ABLE TO JUMP OFF THE SHIP, TWO

00:01:34.881 --> 00:01:37.115
OF THEM SUFFERING MINOR

00:01:37.116 --> 00:01:37.749
INJURIES.

00:01:37.750 --> 00:01:38.517
THE GOOD SAMARITAN LET THEM ONTO

00:01:38.518 --> 00:01:41.887
THEIR BOAT TO GET THEM TO SAFET

00:01:41.888 --> 00:01:42.220
SAFETY.

00:01:42.221 --> 00:01:43.488
CONCEPTION SINK JUST 20 YARDS

00:01:43.489 --> 00:01:46.291
OFFSHORE AND 64 FEET OF WATER

00:01:46.292 --> 00:01:47.359
WHILE FIREFIGHTERS WERE TRYING

00:01:47.360 --> 00:01:47.959
TO POINT OUT THAT FIRE.

00:01:47.960 --> 00:01:51.997
WE MANAGED TO GET VIDEO OF A MAN

00:01:51.998 --> 00:01:53.865
BROUGHT ASHORE ALERT AND TALKING

00:01:53.866 --> 00:01:54.399
TO FIRST RESPONDERS.

00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:56.535
THE DIVE BOAT WAS ON THE LAST

00:01:56.536 --> 00:01:57.235
DAY OF THE LABOR DAY WEEKEND

00:01:57.236 --> 00:02:00.372
CRUISE TO THE CHANNEL ISLANDS

00:02:00.373 --> 00:02:01.139
ABOUT 70 MILES NORTH OF

00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:01.540
LOS ANGELES.

00:02:01.541 --> 00:02:04.109
LOVED ONES GATHERED AT THE

00:02:04.110 --> 00:02:05.176
HARBOR IN SANTA BARBARA WHERE

00:02:05.177 --> 00:02:05.911
THE CONCEPTION WAS BASED, HOPING

00:02:05.912 --> 00:02:07.812
FOR GOOD NEWS.

00:02:07.813 --> 00:02:08.680
THIS MAN JUST FOUND OUT HIS

00:02:08.681 --> 00:02:12.150
BROTHER, A COOK ON THE BOAT HAD

00:02:12.151 --> 00:02:13.585
ESCAPED.

00:02:13.586 --> 00:02:14.319
&gt;&gt; USUALLY HE'S MAKING BREAKFAST

00:02:14.320 --> 00:02:17.422
AT FOUR IN THE MORNING, SO

00:02:17.423 --> 00:02:19.691
SOMETHING HAPPENED.

00:02:19.692 --> 00:02:21.860
HE GOT OFF OF THE BOAT, HE IS

00:02:21.861 --> 00:02:22.661
ONE OF THE SURVIVORS SO I'M

00:02:22.662 --> 00:02:23.361
GOING IN HERE TO TALK TO HIM

00:02:23.362 --> 00:02:26.264
RIGHT NOW.

00:02:26.265 --> 00:02:28.333
&gt;&gt; CALIFORNIA

00:02:28.334 --> 00:02:30.068
SENATOR DIANNE FEINSTEIN ONCE

00:02:30.069 --> 00:02:30.735
ANSWERS.

00:02:30.736 --> 00:02:31.736
SHE RELEASED A STATEMENT JUST

00:02:31.737 --> 00:02:33.338
MOMENTS AGO SAYING THE FBI WILL

00:02:33.339 --> 00:02:35.740
BE INVESTIGATING.

00:02:35.741 --> 00:02:36.474
THE COAST GUARD SAYS AN EARLY

00:02:36.475 --> 00:02:38.710
LOOK AT THE BOAT'S RECORDS SHOWS

00:02:38.711 --> 00:02:40.111
IT IS IN COMPLIANCE WITH STATE

00:02:40.112 --> 00:02:41.948
LAWS AND THAT THE OWNER OF THE

